{
  "$schema": "./_schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "Legacy STT models (Whisper ggml, Vosk), owned by P1-A. Families 'whisper' and 'vosk' install into the legacy",
    "app_data/whisper/ and app_data/vosk-models/ folders that the Whisper plugin and the Vosk WASM loader read,",
    "and files already there are adopted after a hash check instead of being downloaded again.",
    "Whisper ids are 'whisper/<id the Whisper plugin persists>'. Pin with scripts/models/pin-catalog.mjs.",
    "Vosk: alphacephei.com publishes no digests. vosk/small-en-us-0.15 was hashed from a real download (it matches the",
    "zip Sigil fetched earlier). The other ten vosk/* sha256 and size values were added during P1 without a recorded",
    "pin-catalog run and have not been checked against the files yet: before relying on them, re-derive them with",
    "'node scripts/models/pin-catalog.mjs --only vosk/ --force --hash-by-download' (a dry run prints any difference;",
    "about 475 MB, sequential; needs consent), or smoke one with 'Sigil.exe --headless fetch vosk/small-pt-0.3' against",
    "a scratch SIGIL_APP_DATA_DIR. A wrong value makes that language fail with 'the file does not match the catalog'."
  ],
